  "solution": "<div class=\"with-figure\"><div><ol class=\"alpha-list\"><li>Gọi <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mi>I</mi></semantics></math> là trung điểm của <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>B</mi><mi>C</mi></mrow></semantics></math>, khi đó ta có\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"math-display\"><math display=\"block\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mrow><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"prefix\">{</mo><mtable><mtr><mtd columnalign=\"right\" style=\"text-align: right\"/><mtd columnalign=\"left\" style=\"text-align: left\"><mi>B</mi><mi>C</mi><mo>⊥</mo><mi>A</mi><mi>I</mi></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd columnalign=\"right\" style=\"text-align: right\"/><mtd columnalign=\"left\" style=\"text-align: left\"><mi>B</mi><mi>C</mi><mo>⊥</mo><mi>A</mi><mi>A</mi><mi>′</mi></mtd></mtr></mtable></mrow><mo>⇒</mo><mi>B</mi><mi>C</mi><mo>⊥</mo><mrow><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"prefix\">(</mo><mi>A</mi><mi>A</mi><mi>′</mi><mi>I</mi><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"postfix\">)</mo></mrow><mi>.</mi></mrow></semantics></math></div>\n\t\t\t\tMà <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"prefix\">{</mo><mtable><mtr><mtd columnalign=\"right\" style=\"text-align: right\"/><mtd columnalign=\"left\" style=\"text-align: left\"><mrow><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"prefix\">(</mo><mi>A</mi><mi>A</mi><mi>′</mi><mi>I</mi><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"postfix\">)</mo></mrow><mo>∩</mo><mrow><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"prefix\">(</mo><mi>A</mi><mi>B</mi><mi>C</mi><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"postfix\">)</mo></mrow><mo>=</mo><mi>A</mi><mi>I</mi></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd columnalign=\"right\" style=\"text-align: right\"/><mtd columnalign=\"left\" style=\"text-align: left\"><mrow><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"prefix\">(</mo><mi>A</mi><mi>A</mi><mi>′</mi><mi>I</mi><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"postfix\">)</mo></mrow><mo>∩</mo><mrow><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"prefix\">(</mo><mi>A</mi><mi>′</mi><mi>B</mi><mi>C</mi><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"postfix\">)</mo></mrow><mo>=</mo><mi>A</mi><mi>′</mi><mi>I</mi></mtd></mtr></mtable></mrow></semantics></math> nên\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"math-display\"><math display=\"block\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mrow><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"prefix\">(</mo><mrow><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"prefix\">(</mo><mi>A</mi><mi>′</mi><mi>B</mi><mi>C</mi><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"postfix\">)</mo></mrow><mo>,</mo><mrow><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"prefix\">(</mo><mi>A</mi><mi>B</mi><mi>C</mi><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"postfix\">)</mo></mrow><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"postfix\">)</mo></mrow><mo>=</mo><mover><mrow><mi>A</mi><mi>′</mi><mi>I</mi><mi>A</mi></mrow><mo accent=\"true\">̂</mo></mover><mo>=</mo><msup><mn>60</mn><mo>∘</mo></msup><mi>.</mi></mrow></semantics></math></div>\n\t\t\t\tVậy khoảng cách giữa hai đáy của hình lăng trụ bằng <div class=\"math-display\"><math display=\"block\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>A</mi><mi>A</mi><mi>′</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>A</mi><mi>I</mi><mo>⋅</mo><mo>tan</mo><mover><mrow><mi>A</mi><mi>′</mi><mi>I</mi><mi>A</mi></mrow><mo accent=\"true\">̂</mo></mover><mo>=</mo><mfrac displaystyle=\"true\"><mrow><mi>a</mi><msqrt><mn>3</mn></msqrt></mrow><mn>2</mn></mfrac><mo>⋅</mo><msqrt><mn>3</mn></msqrt><mo>=</mo><mfrac displaystyle=\"true\"><mrow><mn>3</mn><mi>a</mi></mrow><mn>2</mn></mfrac><mi>.</mi></mrow></semantics></math></div></li><li>Diện tích <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>△</mi><mi>A</mi><mi>B</mi><mi>C</mi></mrow></semantics></math> là <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>S</mi><mrow><mi>△</mi><mi>A</mi><mi>B</mi><mi>C</mi></mrow></msub><mo>=</mo><mfrac displaystyle=\"true\"><mrow><msup><mi>a</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><msqrt><mn>3</mn></msqrt></mrow><mn>4</mn></mfrac></mrow></semantics></math>. <br>Suy ra thể tích khối lăng trụ là <div class=\"math-display\"><math display=\"block\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>V</mi><mo>=</mo><msub><mi>S</mi><mrow><mi>△</mi><mi>A</mi><mi>B</mi><mi>C</mi></mrow></msub><mo>⋅</mo><mi>A</mi><mi>A</mi><mi>′</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac displaystyle=\"true\"><mrow><mn>3</mn><msup><mi>a</mi><mn>3</mn></msup><msqrt><mn>3</mn></msqrt></mrow><mn>8</mn></mfrac><mi>.</mi></mrow></semantics></math></div></li></ol></div><div class=\"side-figure\"><figure class=\"tex-figure\"><img src=\"/bank-assets/685f4307f270f879e30a492dab2b06c088273b57e935867a1413ec709c684c7b.svg\" alt=\"Hình minh họa\" loading=\"lazy\"><span class=\"figure-zoom\" aria-hidden=\"true\">⤢</span></figure></div></div>",
